# Stable spec ID: morgenthaler-andalusian-buck. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(gin) 30 ml
(sherry; amontillado) 30 ml
(lime: juice, fresh) 15 ml
(simple syrup, 2:1 Demerara sugar to water) 5 ml
(ginger beer) 60 ml

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(highball glass, Collins)

::instructions
<shake, gin and sherry and lime juice and syrup with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
(ginger beer) <add, after shaking>
<pour, slowly over fresh ice in chilled (highball glass, Collins)>
<garnish, with a lime wheel>

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
Source prefers its linked homemade ginger beer, but permits a commercial one. OSF leaves ginger beer generic and does not infer an exact brand. Never shake after adding carbonation.

